      "statement": "Every Choice answer is validated against its own options: unknown labels, non-finite or out-of-range probabilities, sums missing 1 beyond tolerance (widened for two-decimal rounding), and bad confidence raise MalformedChoice, which the ranker turns into RankingFailed while keeping the request's Call; valid answers are renormalized and ties broken by option order.",
